id=firewall_default_deny
name=Firewall Default Deny
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=2
author=
description=Blocks Internet access for newly installed user apps by default via NetworkPolicyManager. Event-driven via inotifyd on /data/system/packages.xml; changes are reflected in the system Settings UI (LineageOS / AOSP-based ROMs, API 26+). Ships the firewallctl CLI.
